message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the final PhasePair paper and software
  release. The preferred paper citation will be added only after its metadata
  and release identity are final.
title: "PhasePair: phase-aware dyadic periodic motion-language retrieval"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "PhasePair contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/appleweiping/phasepair-periodic-motion-language"
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
keywords:
  - motion-language retrieval
  - periodic motion
  - dyadic motion
  - phase-aware representation
  - reproducible research
abstract: >-
  Data-free reference implementation and auditable research artifacts for a
  phase-aware dyadic periodic motion-language retrieval study. This software
  record does not claim empirical results; restricted datasets and model
  weights are not redistributed.
